\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.988440188893673*^9, 
  3.9884402022462873`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1e8fd795-4257-4221-90e7-\
5383561a448e"],

Cell["(*Exit[]*)", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[201]:=",ExpressionUUID->"0c838895-790d-471f-8e52-89f359bcdefc"],

Cell["\<\
(* Initialisation flag: set True to see all plots, False to skip them
   and keep the saved notebook size small. *)
showPlots = False;\
\>", "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.999335669934176*^9, 3.999335672364497*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[202]:=",ExpressionUUID->"904af919-50b3-4110-b236-8030f409573a"],

Cell["\<\
(* Global style options for all plot types.
   ListDensityPlot and ContourPlot use FontSize 26 to match the \
arXiv:2606.24705 figure style; all other plot types use 14. *)\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
